        "grammar.i_am"
      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "अपने बारे में बोलना हो तो ‘I am’. मैं = I, हूँ = am. जैसे: I am happy = मैं खुश हूँ।",
        "hinglish": "Apne baare mein bolna ho to ‘I am’. Main = I, hoon = am. Jaise: I am happy = Main khush hoon.",
        "en": "To talk about yourself, say ‘I am’. Like: I am happy."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "learn_card",
      "id": "L3.U02.S02",
      "skills": [
        "grammar.i_am"
      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "ध्यान दो: ‘I’ के साथ हमेशा ‘am’ आता है, कभी ‘is’ नहीं। I is ❌ I am ✅",
        "hinglish": "Dhyaan do: ‘I’ ke saath hamesha ‘am’ aata hai, kabhi ‘is’ nahi. I is ❌ I am ✅",
        "en": "Remember: ‘I’ always goes with ‘am’, never ‘is’. I is ❌ I am ✅"
      }
    },
